00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:51.390
And this happens a couple times a year, and he always procrastinates wildly on these days.

379
00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:57.470
As a former secretary, I really relate to the dynamic between Pam and Michael in this episode.

380
00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:00.190
Because during one of my early secretarial jobs,

381
00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:12.330
I had a boss that would take so long to do his end of the month report that I would have to drive to the airport because the FedEx at the airport had the latest drop time.

382
00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:20.210
I'm saying LAX airport, which anyone who lives in Los Angeles, if I drive to LAX now, it's about a two-hour drive.

