00:31:47.380 --> 00:31:54.220
Like, there's a scene later we'll talk about, but, you know, Kevin sits on Michael's lap when

764
00:31:54.220 --> 00:31:54.780
he's Santa.

765
00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:56.220
Oh, yes.

