00:33:18.060 --> 00:33:20.220
I would like to go eat some chips.

804
00:33:20.360 --> 00:33:24.860
Maybe some sour cream and onion chips from the basket.

805
00:33:25.020 --> 00:33:27.880
Well, clearly, you just want to be the gift that keeps on giving in here.

806
00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:29.520
Yes.

807
00:33:29.720 --> 00:33:29.940
All right.

