00:34:19.500 --> 00:34:24.600
And we got tons of questions about these finger snaps, which I think is why I felt compelled

834
00:34:24.600 --> 00:34:25.660
to write down the time code.

835
00:34:25.940 --> 00:34:28.900
The question was, was this scripted or improvised?

836
00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:34.860
I remember it as being improvised, and I remember being so tickled by it because I'm a huge movie

837
00:34:34.860 --> 00:34:39.260
musical fan, and I asked Lee Eisenberg, and he thinks it was also improvised.

838
00:34:39.380 --> 00:34:40.680
