00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:17.480
We got a lot of questions about this scene.

941
00:39:17.660 --> 00:39:19.260
I have questions, so go.

942
00:39:19.780 --> 00:39:23.840
Well, in Office Olympics, Angela has her bit about Pam Pong.

943
00:39:24.020 --> 00:39:24.380
Yes.

944
00:39:24.560 --> 00:39:28.360
And that's kind of the first time that Pam is made aware

945
00:39:28.360 --> 00:39:30.040
that someone else is aware.

946
00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:31.360
People are noticing.

947
00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:31.900
Yes.

948
00:39:32.300 --> 00:39:39.320
And now, in this scene, Meredith clocks the interaction between Pam and Jim.

949
00:39:39.460 --> 00:39:41.520
And that is what freaks out Pam.

950
00:39:41.820 --> 00:39:43.160
Also, your shirt came up.

951
00:39:43.240 --> 00:39:44.280
And you could see your belly.

952
00:39:44.480 --> 00:39:50.200
Now, I remember as your friend that week, you saying to me, oh, my gosh, oh, my gosh,

953
00:39:50.680 --> 00:39:51.860
people are going to see my belly.

954
00:39:52.040 --> 00:39:54.460
Because it said, you know, it picks up and your shirt kind of comes up.

955
00:39:54.540 --> 00:39:55.740
And you were nervous about it.

956
00:39:55.800 --> 00:39:55.980
Yeah.

957
00:39:57.060 --> 00:39:58.580
So that was a fan question.

958
00:39:58.580 --> 00:40:02.100
Anthony asked, was it meant for your shirt to pull up when Jim lifted you?

959
00:40:02.200 --> 00:40:04.400
Or did it happen on accident and you went with it?

960
00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:07.880
It was in the script that my shirt would come up a little bit.

961
00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:14.040
And that was all to make it even more of a vulnerable thing for Pam.

962
00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:16.360
That she was literally exposed.

963
00:40:16.760 --> 00:40:16.900
Yeah.

964
00:40:17.000 --> 00:40:18.920
Something that you were really embarrassed about.

965
00:40:18.920 --> 00:40:19.400
Yes.

966
00:40:19.620 --> 00:40:22.420
And wow, I wish my stomach looked like that today.

967
00:40:22.940 --> 00:40:24.500
I watched that scene.

968
00:40:24.720 --> 00:40:31.260
I was like, why was I not wearing midriff tops every day when I looked like that?

969
00:40:31.460 --> 00:40:32.100
I know.

970
00:40:32.220 --> 00:40:33.440
I knew you were going to say that.

971
00:40:33.580 --> 00:40:36.820
Because I mean, listen, we've had babies.

972
00:40:37.040 --> 00:40:38.980
And everything changes after that.

973
00:40:39.120 --> 00:40:41.620
And you're, I mean, you look phenomenal today, Jenna.

974
00:40:41.740 --> 00:40:42.680
You look phenomenal then.

975
00:40:42.860 --> 00:40:45.940
But I know, I remember our bellies before babies.

976
00:40:45.940 --> 00:40:46.560
I remember.

977
00:40:46.560 --> 00:40:51.300
Well, I am kind of glad that it was scripted that you see my belly.

978
00:40:51.420 --> 00:40:53.380
Because I've got it on film now.

979
00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:57.780
That at one time in my life, I had a cute little belly and belly button.

980
00:40:58.060 --> 00:41:00.180
So thank you, Jean and Lee, for that.

981
00:41:00.860 --> 00:41:05.180
At 13 minutes, 56 seconds, that's my third time code, Angela.

